OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786598357
OL,3,CHampshire astronomy enthusiast
OL,4,Ctravelling over 1000 miles to watch
OL,5,Csolar eclipse
OL,7,FAn astronomy enthusiast from Hampshire
OL,8,Fhas revealed he's travelling more than
OL,9,F1000 miles to see the most significant
OL,10,Fsolar eclipse since 1999.
OL,12,FMore than 90% of the sun will be
OL,13,Fobscured by the moon between about 6pm
OL,14,Fand 8.15pm this evening (12 August),
OL,15,Fthe most it has been blocked above UK
OL,16,Fskies for decades.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
