FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786598357
OL,3,CHampshire astronomy enthusiast
OL,4,Ctravelling over 1000 miles to watch
OL,5,Csolar eclipse
OL,7,FDavid Phillips of Hampshire
OL,8,FAstronomical Society has seen a
OL,9,Fstaggering eight totalities in his
OL,10,Flifetime starting with a partial
OL,11,Feclipse back in 1976.
OL,13,F"I was only a small child and I had a
OL,14,Fsort of little blank slide film that I
OL,15,Fused to, to observe the sun.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786598357
OL,3,CHampshire astronomy enthusiast
OL,4,Ctravelling over 1000 miles to watch
OL,5,Csolar eclipse
OL,7,F"It's not something I would recommend
OL,8,Ftoday because you really need to have
OL,9,Fsome proper eclipse glasses in order
OL,10,Fto be able to look safely, but I do
OL,11,Frecall distinctly seeing the moon
OL,12,Ftravelling across the surface of the
OL,13,Fsun.
OL,15,F"Later in life I had the opportunity
OL,16,Fto go and see a total eclipse from
OL,17,FFrance in 1999.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786598357
OL,3,CHampshire astronomy enthusiast
OL,4,Ctravelling over 1000 miles to watch
OL,5,Csolar eclipse
OL,7,F"Since then I've worked in the travel
OL,8,Findustry for the last 20 years, and
OL,9,Fduring that time I've seen a total of
OL,10,Feight totals, and two annular
OL,11,Feclipses, as well as a lot of partial
OL,12,Feclipses and transits."
OL,14,FViewing events are set to take place
OL,15,Facross the UK and Europe as stargazers
OL,16,Fgather to witness a rare partial solar
OL,17,Feclipse ` but forecasters have warned
OL,18,Fthe event is likely to be hidden
OL,19,Fbehind clouds in many areas.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786598357
OL,3,CHampshire astronomy enthusiast
OL,4,Ctravelling over 1000 miles to watch
OL,5,Csolar eclipse
OL,7,FDavid is travelling to a flat top hill
OL,8,Fin the town of Aguilar de Campoo in
OL,9,FNorthern Spain to watch this evening's
OL,10,Fspectacle as the country will see its
OL,11,Ffirst total solar eclipse on the
OL,12,Fmainland since 1905 and the skies are
OL,13,Fexpected to be clear.
OL,15,F"It's an extraordinary experience like
OL,16,Fno other I can describe in life for me
OL,17,Fit's something that I think everybody
OL,18,Fshould try and see once if they can.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786598357
OL,3,CHampshire astronomy enthusiast
OL,4,Ctravelling over 1000 miles to watch
OL,5,Csolar eclipse
OL,7,F"The light level really drops and you
OL,8,Fget to see features of the sun's
OL,9,Fatmosphere that you can not see at any
OL,10,Fother time."
OL,12,FAt the Winchester Science centre,
OL,13,Ftickets have sold out for a special
OL,14,Fevent where experts will be on hand to
OL,15,Fguide visitors through the experience
OL,16,Fand children can watch a planetarium
OL,17,Fshow to learn about the rare sight.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786598357
OL,3,CHampshire astronomy enthusiast
OL,4,Ctravelling over 1000 miles to watch
OL,5,Csolar eclipse
OL,7,FSpeaking to ITV Meridian, the centre's
OL,8,Fplanetarium officer, Anna Gammon-Ross,
OL,9,Fsaid: "This eclipse is really exciting
OL,10,Fto be able to get children excited
OL,11,Fabout the solar system and everything
OL,12,Fgoing on around us.
OL,14,F"It's to do with the sun and the moon,
OL,15,Fthings we see kind of all the time
OL,16,Faround us, but don't necessarily take
OL,17,Fthat time to look a little bit closer,
OL,18,Fand actually think about what is going
OL,19,Fon, and why we're in this special
OL,20,Flocation in our solar system.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786598357
OL,3,CHampshire astronomy enthusiast
OL,4,Ctravelling over 1000 miles to watch
OL,5,Csolar eclipse
OL,7,F"I'm sure loads of kids have read
OL,8,Fabout it in books, and read maybe
OL,9,Fabout it at school in studies, but
OL,10,Fthis makes it real."
OL,12,FChildren there have been getting ready
OL,13,Ffor the spectacle.
OL,15,FSpeaking to ITV Meridian, one mum said
OL,16,Fshe remembers the 1999 eclipse well.
OL,18,F"I'm more excited than the kids," she
OL,19,Fsaid. "Because I remember the last one
OL,20,Fin 1999 when I was 13, so I remember
OL,21,Fhow excited I was.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
